WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.895 --> 00:00:06.138
Eight versioned synthetic coverage packs. No inference on page load.

2
00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:11.252
Create an authored Medicare Advantage proposal with independently calculated expectations. It remains unapproved.

3
00:00:11.252 --> 00:00:16.323
The evidence assistant cites saved facts. It cannot approve or execute.

4
00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:21.544
Assign an owner and route for review. Routing is distinct from approval.

5
00:00:21.544 --> 00:00:27.971
Explicit engineering inspection approves the current snapshot. No automatic or human review is claimed.

6
00:00:27.971 --> 00:00:33.343
Run the approved case through actual HTTP with fresh disposable state. Full observations match.

7
00:00:33.343 --> 00:00:38.499
A frozen calculator control makes zero model calls. Raw local AI requires its own explicit selection.

8
00:00:38.499 --> 00:00:46.897
The same workbench is available on a phone-width layout.
